om/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />400<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>枝叶形头冠，饰以乌金纸剪裁的飞蛾翅膀，点缀饱满如果实的珍珠，因其接近自然的向上生长的形态而格外优雅。自然主义美学在哪里都不会过时。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/21/Belonging-300306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">璎珞腰饰<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Yingluo Waist Jewelry</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />85<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>佩戴在腰间的璎珞，通过编缀的手段把金银、玉片、砗磲连接在一起。纤长地垂落于腰侧，在步履间灵动地摇晃。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300307.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/98/Belonging-300307.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">青白银绣披帛<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Silver Embroidery Pibo</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-wid